  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Local Integration and Social Cohesion in Bogot&#xe1;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a joint initiative between IOM and Bogot&#xe1;&#x2019;s Office of the High Counselor for Peace, Victims, and Reconciliation aimed at strengthening peaceful coexistence, social cohesion, and local integration in the city. Through participatory, pedagogical, and psychosocial strategies, the project supports victims of the armed conflict and host communities while enhancing institutional coordination for the implementation of the Local Integration Public Policy (PPIL). The initiative develops community-based processes, pedagogical actions for peace, technical capacity-building, and support for Collective Reparation Subjects. Overall, it promotes inclusive territories, cultural transformation, and sustainable local integration aligned with Bogot&#xe1;&#x2019;s development priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
